xnu 0385: WebKit's GPU process gets the Metal provider at exec

The GPU process renders its page surfaces through Metal and they stay
zero (0379/0380) because this port has no Metal device to offer. The
device now exists (AdrenoMetal over metal2vulkan over Turnip, m2v_test
passing end to end with 0384), and it reaches a process only through
DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES: measured 2026-11-19, a dylib dlopen'd after the
call bound does not change MTLCreateSystemDefaultDevice.

So the process name is a target beside the others, and its line is the
provider dylib in /private/var/vm instead of the hook. Gated by
mondrian_probe_switch(), so a default boot injects nothing new.

--- a/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
@@ -5660,6 +5660,12 @@
  * depend on a file in /private/var/vm.
  */
